---
layout: main
title: Tempo Adjust
description: Tempo Adjust is a set of browser extensions that let DJs detect and adjust the tempo of tracks on Bandcamp and Discogs.
bodyClass: "product-page"
image: "/images/tempo-adjust-logo.png"
---

{% import 'components.njk' as components %}

<section class="header">
  <div class="header__logo-container">
    <img
      src="{{ image }}"
      alt="{{ title }}"
      class="header__logo--h1 og-image"
    />
  </div>
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
</section>

<section>
  <p>{{ description }}</p>
  <p>
    Tempo Adjust is available as two extensions for Chrome and Firefox, one for
    each site. A single Safari app for Mac, iPhone, and iPad that covers both
    sites is in the works.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="install" class="install">
  <h2 id="chrome" class="header">
    <span class="header__logo-container">
      <img src="/images/chrome-icon.png" alt="" class="header__logo--h3" />
    </span>
    Install on Chrome
  </h2>
  <div>
    {{
      components.linkButton("Bandcamp Tempo Adjust",
      "https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/bandcamp-tempo-adjust/iniomjoihcjgakkfaebmcbnhmiobppel",
      "/images/bandcamp-tempo-adjust-logo.png")
    }}
    {{
      components.linkButton("Discogs Tempo Adjust",
      "https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/discogs-tempo-adjust/lifpcepdalajjkklljnfcjpjjjllfhha",
      "/images/discogs-tempo-adjust-logo.png", "invert-on-dark")
    }}
  </div>

  <h2 id="firefox" class="header">
    <span class="header__logo-container">
      <img src="/images/firefox-icon.png" alt="" class="header__logo--h3" />
    </span>
    Install on Firefox
  </h2>
  <div>
    {{
      components.linkButton("Bandcamp Tempo Adjust",
      "https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/bandcamp-tempo-adjust/",
      "/images/bandcamp-tempo-adjust-logo.png")
    }}
    {{
      components.linkButton("Discogs Tempo Adjust",
      "https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/discogs-tempo-adjust/",
      "/images/discogs-tempo-adjust-logo.png", "invert-on-dark")
    }}
  </div>

  <h2 id="safari" class="header">
    <span class="header__logo-container">
      <img src="{{ image }}" alt="" class="header__logo--h3" />
    </span>
    Install on Safari
  </h2>
  <p>Coming soon to the App Store for Mac, iPhone, and iPad.</p>
</section>

<section class="install">
  <h2 id="contribute">Contribute</h2>
  <div>
    {{
      components.linkButton("GitHub",
      "https://github.com/azarbayejani/bandcamp-tempo-adjust",
      "/images/github-icon.png", "invert-on-dark")
    }}
    {{
      components.linkButton("Donate to support the project",
      "https://buymeacoffee.com/miseryconfusion",
      "/images/donate-icon.png", "invert-on-dark")
    }}
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Tempo adjustment:</strong> a pitch fader for every player, on
      album, track, and collection pages on Bandcamp and on release videos on
      Discogs
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Master tempo:</strong> change the tempo without changing the pitch
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>BPM detection:</strong> detect the BPM of any track (Bandcamp
      only)
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Purchase export:</strong> export your Bandcamp purchases with
      currency conversion to analyze your spending
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <p><em>On Bandcamp:</em></p>
  <img
    src="/images/bandcamp-tempo-adjust-screenshot.png"
    alt="Bandcamp Tempo Adjust screenshot"
    class="full-width-image"
  />
</section>

<section>
  <p><em>On Discogs:</em></p>
  <img
    src="/images/discogs-tempo-adjust-screenshot.png"
    alt="Discogs Tempo Adjust screenshot"
    class="full-width-image"
  />
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Press</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://ra.co/news/81694"
        >New free web extension allows Discogs users to adjust tempos</a
      >, Resident Advisor, November 2024
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://cdm.link/bandcamp-and-discogs-tempo-adjust/"
        >Bandcamp and Discogs Tempo Adjust has a new UI</a
      >, CDM, November 2024
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <p>
    <small
      >Tempo Adjust does not collect any data. Read the
      <a href="/tempo-adjust/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</small
    >
  </p>
</section>
